SUMMARY:Social Clubs - June
DESCRIPTION:JUNE 2026 \n\n\n\nTuesday\n6/2\n4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nDOVER DAIRY MAID/ DOVER GRILL – CASH ONLY!\n\n\nThursday\n   6/4\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM\n “Thursday’s” Montclair Art Museum ~ ESSEX OFFICE  \n\n\nSaturday \n6/6\n11:00 AM – 1:00 PM \nGREEK FESTIVAL – RANDOLPH \n\n\nTuesday\n6/9\n4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nTARGET PARSIPPANY \n\n\nThursday\n6/11\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM\n“Thursday’s” MOVIE NIGHT ~ ESSEX OFFICE  \n\n\nTuesday\n6/16\n4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\n MORRISTOWN GREEN\n\n\nThursday\n6/18\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM\n “Thursday’s” GAME NIGHT ~ ESSEX OFFICE  \n\n\nSaturday \n6/20\n2:00 PM – 4:00 PM \nTRI-COUNTY FAIR – ROCKAWAY\n\n\nTuesday\n6/23\n4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nHORSESHOE LAKE – SUCCASUNNA \n\n\nThursday\n6/25\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM\n“Thursday’s” BIRTHDAY PARTY (@ VERONA PARK) ~ ESSEX OFFICE   \n\n\nSunday\n6/28\n11:00 Am – 1:00 PM\nHOPATCONG MARKET AND CRAFT FAIR\n\n\nTuesday\n6/30\n4:00 PM – 7:00 PM\nWALMART LEDGEWOOD\n\n\n\nSPACE IS LIMITED!!  \n To register for the events or for more information\, please contact: \nJonathan Hinkis – 973-334-3496 ext. 514 \nWeekdays 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM \nLight refreshments will be served \nPrizes available for winners \n***ACTIVITIES SUBJECT TO CHANGE &/OR CANCELLATION***
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/social-clubs-june/2026-06-30/
CATEGORIES:Social Clubs
END:VEVENT
